    effortless-ntwf:questionText "Since I took over on 2026-04-01, is my triage quality better or worse than maria-chen's during the 2025-01-01 to 2026-03-31 human pilot?" ;
    effortless-ntwf:whyItMatters "'Did quality change at the handover' is the question a regulator asks and nobody can answer. The human pilot period was preserved deliberately — `ra-old-variance` is Superseded, not deleted — so a baseline EXISTS. But quality is currently unmeasurable for either side, because no decision-grain record exists. The same predicates must evaluate on both agents so the comparison is apples-to-apples rather than two different narratives." ;
    effortless-ntwf:answerableBefore false ;
    effortless-ntwf:witnessedAnswer "RoleAssignments.QualityRegressedVsPredecessor=0/13" ;
