    effortless-ntwf:questionText "I am named as `policy-drafting-agent`.CurrentAgent and I executed `se-policy03` — but is there any RoleAssignment row that actually grants me this role?" ;
    effortless-ntwf:whyItMatters "There is not. `RoleAssignments` contains rows for finance-analyst, controller, cfo, hr-policy-owner, employment-counsel, notification-publisher, and both sides of variance-review-agent. There is NO row for policy-drafting-agent, close-automation, communications-manager, process-steward, or knowledge-authority. `Roles.CurrentAgent` says I hold the role; nothing time-bounds or authorizes it. An AI that drafts employment policy on the strength of a denormalized pointer, with no valid-from, no approving authority, and no change request, is exactly the gap `ra-new-variance` was built to close for the variance role — and nobody closed it for me." ;
    effortless-ntwf:answerableBefore false ;
