# === Individuals: WitnessLoops ===

effortless-ntwf:loop-01 a effortless-ntwf:WitnessLoops ;
    effortless-ntwf:witnessLoopId "loop-01" ;
    effortless-ntwf:loopNumber "1" ;
    effortless-ntwf:title "The founding questions" ;
    effortless-ntwf:premise "The model specified obligations precisely and witnessed their breach almost nowhere. Requirements, verifications, exceptions, and communication policies were all stated with real precision, and in each case the execution-side counterpart that would catch a violation was missing. Loop 1 asks each of the twelve named roles what it actually needs to know, and invents the atomic predicates required to answer." ;
    effortless-ntwf:startedAt "2026-07-19T17:00:00-05:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    effortless-ntwf:completedAt "2026-07-19T19:30:00-05:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    effortless-ntwf:fieldsAfter "1096" ;
    effortless-ntwf:derivedAfter "559" ;
    effortless-ntwf:witnessedAfter "462" ;
    effortless-ntwf:semanticTypeIri "urn:effortless:pko-extension#WitnessLoop" .

effortless-ntwf:loop-02 a effortless-ntwf:WitnessLoops ;
    effortless-ntwf:witnessLoopId "loop-02" ;
    effortless-ntwf:loopNumber "2" ;
    effortless-ntwf:title "Questions only loop 1 made askable" ;
    effortless-ntwf:premise "Loop 1 established WHAT can go wrong: a blocking control unmet, a verification skipped, a send refused, a claim whose source has left. Loop 2 asks the questions that only exist once those columns do — about the QUALITY of the assurance rather than its presence. Three examples that had no expressible form before loop 1 ran: only 4 of 13 requirements have any computed witness at all, so which controls are still trusted purely on assertion; verification_outcomes.is_self_witnessed reads 3/4, so how much of the evidence is the executor vouching for themselves; and send_intents.is_silently_dropped reads 4/7, a failure mode that could not be named until IsClearedToSend existed to refuse a send in the first place. Every loop-2 question records, in its own provenance, the loop-1 predicates that made it possible." ;
    effortless-ntwf:startedAt "2026-07-19T19:45:00-05:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    effortless-ntwf:completedAt "2026-07-19T20:30:00-05:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    effortless-ntwf:fieldsAfter "1479" ;
    effortless-ntwf:derivedAfter "906" ;
    effortless-ntwf:witnessedAfter "836" ;
    effortless-ntwf:semanticTypeIri "urn:effortless:pko-extension#WitnessLoop" .
